================================================================================
DISPOSITION
================================================================================
A complete, HIG-native SwiftUI SharedDrivePage shipped at parity with the web public share report: a
pure @Observable SharedDrivePageModel (ADR-004 — no networking in the view) that fetches via a
SharedDriveDataSource seam (useSharedDrive / GET /share/{token}) and normalizes the v1|v2 wire union
to one SI payload (web normalizeSharedDriveData), exposing loading/ready/expired plus the derived
map/chart selectors and the no-route empty branch. The view reproduces every web region — branded
header, hero MapKit route map (polyline + green start / red end circle markers + style switcher),
title/description/date/endpoints, the 7-tile adaptive stat grid, the vehicle GlassPanel, the elevation
(AreaChart) + speed (LineChart) Swift-Charts profiles, the no-map-data empty panel, and the footer —
all SI-in/display-out via the shared Units engine, adaptive across macOS/iPad+iPhone, with 20 web
share.* keys verbatim and full loading/empty/success + expired states. A typed SharedDriveLink
NavigationDestination + SharedDriveDeepLink parser make /s/:token reachable + deep-linkable without
widening the value-less AppRoute enum (sibling TripReplay/DriveDetail precedent). Verified by xcodegen,
swiftformat --lint (0/11), scoped swiftlint --strict (0/11), the placeholder scan (0), an EXECUTED
31/31 logic harness, and strict-concurrency isolated type-checks on BOTH idioms (macOS 0 + iOS 0,
incl. previews + the iOS-only branch) — which caught and fixed a real Swift-6 LocalizedStringKey
global-concurrency error before any commit. The full xcodebuild scheme is NOT_RUN: it is gated on the
out-of-scope, P1-owned KMP Shared.xcframework staging (apps/apple/Frameworks/ holds only .gitkeep
here), the identical disposition every sibling P7 apple page recorded; deferred to its owner / the P99
integration gate.

